    <section class="shell section--roomy">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="num">04 / The design</span>
        <div>
          <h2>The small decisions that<br />did the heavy lifting.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-prose reveal" data-delay="1">
        <ul>
          <li>One fixed-width <strong>mono table</strong> for all numeric columns. Advisors
            glanced at alignment to catch errors before they caught the numbers.</li>
          <li>A timeline that <strong>expands in place</strong> rather than pushing users
            to a new page &mdash; preserving the context of the review.</li>
          <li>Filters are <strong>opinionated defaults</strong>, not empty dropdowns.
            &ldquo;Since last review,&rdquo; &ldquo;Only events I need to explain,&rdquo;
            &ldquo;Flagged for follow-up.&rdquo;</li>
          <li>A quiet motion language: 180&nbsp;ms ease-out transitions, no bounce.
            Nothing here wanted to feel playful.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

