            <g fill="oklch(28% 0.04 240)" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" opacity="0.7">
              <text x="62" y="58">Since last review</text>
              <text x="234" y="58">Need to explain</text>
              <text x="408" y="58">Flagged for follow-up</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
          <span class="cs-frame__label">Detail &middot; opinionated filters</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="section-divider reveal" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="section-divider__line"></span>
      <span class="section-divider__dot"></span>
      <span class="section-divider__line"></span>
    </div>

    <section class="shell section--roomy">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="num">05 / Outcomes</span>
        <div>
          <h2>What changed,<br />and how we measured.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-outcomes">
        <div class="o reveal">
          <span class="lbl">Review prep time</span>
          <span class="big tabular">&minus;42%</span>
          <p>Median time to assemble a quarterly review, measured across 34 advisors over six weeks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="o reveal" data-delay="1">
          <span class="lbl">Advisor NPS</span>
          <span class="big tabular">+31</span>
          <p>First meaningful move in four years. Retention for advisors on the new surface climbed from 82% to 94%.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="o reveal" data-delay="2">
          <span class="lbl">Tables removed</span>
          <span class="big tabular">19 &rarr; 1</span>
          <p>One unified timeline table. Every removed table had at least one advocate in the old dashboard &mdash; the process mattered.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="shell">
